    "3": "Because we have completed all previous steps (blitz-blitz the blender for 20 seconds), and have all necessary ingredients (butter), we can now do the step Melt-Melt a small knob of butter in a non-stick frying pan over low-medium heat. And now we have completed this step Melt-Melt a small knob of butter in a non-stick frying pan over low-medium heat.",
    "4": "Because we have completed all previous steps (Serve-Serve the pancakes with chopped strawberries), and have all necessary ingredients (maple syrup), we can now do the step splash-splash maple syrup on plate. And now we have completed this step splash-splash maple syrup on plate.",
